# pgregory.net/rapid writes a failure-replay seed to testdata/rapid/<TestName>/*.fail
# whenever a property test falsifies. These are LOCAL replay fossils, never an artifact:
# a committed .fail pins a stale seed the property test replays forever (a green that hides
# the real, freshly-shrunk counterexample). Reproduce a failure locally, fix the code, let
# rapid delete the seed on the next green — never commit it.
/testdata/rapid/
